    jvdillon/p3-ir-camera            original captures and protocol notes
    skywalker1905/thermal-camera-viewer (Apache-2.0)
                                     frame resynchronisation approach
    xaionaro-go/thermalmaster        doc/reverse-engineering.md
    Phalphy/OpenP3 (MIT)             minimal Linux viewer

Changes in this repository relative to upstream:

  * device profiles extracted into web/js/models.js
  * P2 Max (USB 3474:42b2) added and verified against hardware
    (fw 00.00.01.03, hw P2max-00.01, 256x192 @ 25 fps)
  * unknown product IDs resolve through a documented fallback profile
  * project renamed and documentation rewritten

